    "prerequisites": "Level 8",
    "active": true,
    "description": "<p>CLASS SOUL UNLIVING</p>\n<p>Prerequisites Level 8</p>\n<p>Necromantic force claws you back from the instant of collapse.</p>\n<p>If damage would reduce you to 0 HP, make an opposed, level-based Fortitude saving throw. On a success, you drop to 1 HP instead. This feat has no effect if the triggering damage is essence damage or a damage type to which you have Weakness.</p>\n<p>Works automatically: a blow that would take you to 0 HP asks a Fortitude save against the attacker's Level DC (your own when there is no attacker); a success leaves you at 1 HP. Not against essence damage or a type you are weak to.</p>",
